        "The opportunity\nProperty buyers and guests often judge a listing before contacting the owner or agent. Images are therefore a significant part of the first impression.",
        "Some listings use rushed phone photographs with poor lighting, weak composition, or unhelpful angles. A professional photography shoot may be outside the owner's budget or difficult to arrange.",
