        "The opportunity\nA lead is someone who has already shown interest in a business—for example, by filling out a form, sending a message, or asking about pricing.",
        "Many businesses accumulate leads that never become customers. Some may have been contacted once and never followed up with. Others may have enquired during a busy period and been forgotten.",
