        "I came across your listing for [property]. I noticed an opportunity to improve how some of the photographs are presented.",
        "With your permission, I can prepare a small before-and-after sample so you can judge whether the style is useful. I can also show you an example of a short property walkthrough.",
        "Would you be open to taking a look?\nContent repurposing\nSubject: An idea for getting more from your episodes",
        "Hi [Name],",
