      "id": "chapter-11",
      "number": 11,
      "title": "Risk, Trust, and Quality Standards",
      "paragraphs": [
        "AI makes it easier to generate outputs, but it can also make it easier to produce convincing errors. A professional service provider must understand the risks associated with the work.\n11.1 Never let a generated result bypass review\nReview all client-facing work, especially:\n- Property images.\n- Advertising claims.\n- Website facts.\n- Customer messages.\n- Support answers.\n- Financial or performance reporting.\nA polished result can still be wrong.\n11.2 Protect client and customer data\nFor workflows involving contact lists, CRM records, customer conversations, or private business information:\n- Obtain authorisation.\n- Use only necessary data.\n- Check the AI platform's data-handling terms.\n- Restrict account access.\n- Avoid sharing credentials insecurely.\n- Establish retention and deletion rules.\n- Do not use customer data for unrelated purposes.\n11.3 Respect intellectual property and likeness rights\nBefore using photographs, videos, logos, music, text, voices, or likenesses, confirm the relevant permissions.",
        "This is especially important for:\n- Property listing photographs.\n- Creator transcripts and content.\n- Product images and brand assets.\n- AI-generated spokesperson videos.\n- Customer testimonials.\n- Music and other media in advertisements.\n11.4 Be transparent about AI-generated material\nWhere customers, platforms, advertising rules, or local law require disclosure, disclose synthetic or AI-generated content.",
        "Never fabricate a real customer's testimonial, a creator endorsement, or a spokesperson's personal product experience.\n11.5 Avoid unsupported promises\nDo not guarantee:\n- More property enquiries.\n- A particular conversion rate.\n- A specific number of appointments.\n- Advertising profitability.\n- A chatbot's ability to answer every question.\n- A particular increase in website sales.\nDescribe what you will deliver and how it is intended to help. Measure results honestly."
      ]
